# Probability: hold a step (SEQ, or the voice pages ENV, LFO, EDIT, SEL, FX since wip197) and turn SELECT: its chance, in 5 % steps (a T_PROB lane,
# one per drum track; 100 % is no lane). Played: a kick on every step, step 1 at 50 %, step 2 at
# 5 %, with NOTES OUT on, so midi_out.txt counts the kicks that played.
wait 300
expect part 0
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tapkey w3
key w0 down
turn SELECT -10
key w0 up
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect lanes 1
expect laneval6.0.0.0 50
key w1 down
turn SELECT -19
key w1 up
expect laneval6.0.0.1 5
# back to 100 %: the lane's step is empty again (the lane stays for step 2)
key w0 down
turn SELECT 20
key w0 up
expect laneval6.0.0.0 255
expect lanes 1
# and step 2 back too: no lane left
key w1 down
turn SELECT 30
key w1 up
expect lanes 0
# the voice pages work the same (wip197: they did not, V_PART is not reached on the Tonic): EDIT, then ENV
tap EDIT
expect view 14
key w0 down
turn SELECT -10
key w0 up
expect laneval6.0.0.0 50
tap ENV
expect view 12
key w1 down
turn SELECT -19
key w1 up
expect laneval6.0.0.1 5
expect lanes 1
# a step held on the EDIT page is not an extra jump of the page: still the same view
tap EDIT
key w0 down
turn SELECT 20
key w0 up
expect laneval6.0.0.0 255
expect view 14
# the SEQ page again, from another page
tap SEQ
expect view 7
key w1 down
turn SELECT 30
key w1 up
expect lanes 0
